  "youtube_title": "He Finished the Novel... Then It Became Reality | Omniscient Reader",
  "description": "A short, transformative recap/recommendation of Omniscient Reader using limited excerpts from the official WEBTOON episode as visual evidence. Read the official series on WEBTOON.",
  "script": "Manhwa Drop! This one starts completely normal and then goes off the rails. Kim Dokja has spent years reading an obscure web novel called Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse. Almost nobody else cares about it, but he does. Then he reaches the final chapter. The author messages him directly, thanks him for sticking with the story, and says something weird: the novel will become paid at exactly seven PM. Dokja brushes it off. Then seven o'clock hits. The train jerks. The passengers panic. And suddenly the world around him starts looking terrifyingly similar to the story he just finished. That's when the real question hits: if Dokja knows this story better than anyone, does he already know what happens next? This is Omniscient Reader.",
